  "releaseNotes": "Version 9.3.1: No breaking changes - version bump for consistency with other packages.\n       Version 9.3.0: Added transaction support across repository operations.\n       New: ITransactionScope interface for managing database transactions across multiple operations.\n       All repository methods now support optional transaction scope parameter for atomic multi-operation scenarios.\n       Breaking change: Method signatures updated with optional ITransactionScope parameter (backwards compatible via default null).\n       Enhanced flexibility for complex business operations requiring transactional consistency.",
